  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "飛機次系統",
    "sub_ename": "AIRCRAFT SUBSYSTEM",
    "describe_ch": "此課程係強調瞭解通用航空飛機的各系統為主，內容經常需要本課程並不涵蓋的部份物理學、數學和化學的專門知識配合。課程包刮下列各主題的內容：1.機體結構和起落架、2.發動機、3.飛機動力系統、4.飛行操控系統、5.燃油系統、6.環境控制系統。\r\n\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "The course stresses knowledge of general-aviation aircraft systems. The material often requires specialized knowledge of physics, mathematics, and chemistry not covered in the course. It includes information on the following subject：1. airframe and landing gear systems, 2. powerplants, 3. flight vehicle power systems, 4. flight control systems, 5. fuel systems, 6. environmental control systems.",
